.nextInt();\n        }\n        sc.close();\n\n        int n1 = n / 2;\n        int[] a1 = Arrays.copyOfRange(a, 0, n1);\n        int[] a2 = Arrays.copyOfRange(a, n1, n);\n\n        ArrayList<Integer> sums1 = getSums(a1, m);\n        ArrayList<Integer> sums2 = getSums(a2, m);\n\n        // Remove duplicates and sort\n        TreeSet<Integer> set = new TreeSet<>(sums1);\n        ArrayList<Integer> unique = new ArrayList<>(set);\n\n        int ans = 0;\n        for (int s2 : sums2) {\n            int target = m - s2;\n            int idx = Collections.binarySearch(unique, target);\n            if (idx < 0) {\n                idx = -idx - 2; // largest element less than target\n            } else {\n                idx = idx - 1; // strictly less than target\n            }\n            if (idx >= 0) {\n                int cand = unique.get(idx) + s2;\n                if (cand > ans) {\n                    ans = cand;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        System.out.println(ans);\n    }\n\n    private static ArrayList<Integer> getSums(int[] arr, int mod) {\n        ArrayList<Integer> sums = new ArrayList<>();\n        sums.add(0);\n        for (int x : arr) {\n            ArrayList<Integer> newSums = new ArrayList<>();\n            for (int s : sums) {\n                newSums.add((s + x) % mod);\n                newSums.add(s);\n            }\n            sums = newSums;\n        }\n        return sums;\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n1.0\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-8.344646857949556e-07, 0.0, 0.0, -1.6569954823353328e-05, -2.992108420585282e-05, 0.0, -0.00012337400403339416, -0.006009367760270834, -4.410734163684538e-06, 0.0, -1.5735502529423684e-05, -7.581423415103927e-05, -1.7523612768854946e-05, -0.002138829091563821, 0.0, -0.0076210228726267815, 0.0, 0.0, -2.3841855067985307e-07, 0.0, -8.344646857949556e-07, -5.960446742392378e-06, 0.0, -2.264974000354414e-06, -0.0005570290377363563, 0.0, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, 0.0